<Base title="About this plumbing preview"><div class="interior"><h1>About this preview</h1><p>This is an independent design proof of concept for a plumbing website. The config version uses a clearly labeled sample brand. The sheet version uses public business details to show how the same design can serve different businesses.</p></div><article class="reading"><section><h2>A business name is not an endorsement.</h2><p>The real businesses in the demo did not commission or approve this preview. Their names and public contact details are research examples, not evidence of a partnership. We do not reproduce their logos, ratings, testimonials, or licensing claims.</p></section><section><h2>Useful pages before more pages.</h2><p>Each service page answers a different problem. Area pages explain how to prepare a service inquiry rather than claiming local expertise we have not established. A launch-ready site needs the owner's approved business facts, work examples, and service boundaries.</p></section><a data-business-source hidden href="#" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">View the verified business source ↗</a></article></Base>
